            "review_title": "Review at Bun Cha Burger",
            "review_text": "2TravelTheWorld\nNorfolk, Virginia238 contributions\n0\nCome here for the craft beer or the rooftop bar and stay for a unique delicious meal\nAug 2020 • Friends\nI live in Hanoi and have been here many times. CRAFT BEER here! The cuisine is innovative and thoughtful, with lots of food knowledge woven into the menu. There are plenty of vegan options but the beef burger is outstanding in flavor and complexity. My instinct was to use ketchup but the bun cha sauce brings it to perfection (they don’t offer ketchup anyway. There’s a commanding view of Truc Bach Lake from the top floor and the bar there has a nice vibe. The location is easy to miss; the doorway is tucked in a narrow opening. Come join the chess games on Sunday or the vegan buffet on Saturday. The owner is a genuine foodie and it shows!\nRead more\nWritten September 11, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
