            "review_title": "Review at Bun Cha Burger",
            "review_text": "TravelinGypsey\n305 contributions\n0\nThe Best Vegan 🌱 Buffet In Hanoi!\nAug 2020 • Couples\nThe Best Vegan 🌱 Buffet In Hanoi!! \n\nEverything on their menu is delicious and fresh!!! They by far have the best options and the most variety, flavor, freshness and most delicious “true” vegan options in Hanoi! The Vegan buffet is a good size spread of delicious and fresh items that range from traditional Vietnamese dishes that have a twist to basic and flavor packed favorites anyone can enjoy; even if your not vegan!!! The price is also wonderful!! It’s less than 100k for all you can eat! We have been to several vegan buffets and this one so far is the top choice! It is only available on weekends, but until 2:30pm which is a perfect brunch hour slot; an absolute must try!!! \n\nFollow @travelingypsey on Instagram & GoogleMaps for any travel questions & more insights!!!\nRead more\nWritten August 1, 2020",
