            "review_text": "2TravelTheWorld\nNorfolk, Virginia238 contributions\n0\nCraft beer here! You will NOT want ketchup and they don’t have it anyway!\nJun 2020 • Couples\nBeen here thrice. The cuisine is innovative and thoughtful, with lots of food knowledge woven into the simple menu. There’s plenty of vegan choices but the beef burger is outstanding in flavor and complexity. The instinct was to use ketchup but bun cha sauce brings it to perfection. The tacos are as unique and flavorful as the burgers. There’s a commanding view from the top floor and the bar there has a nice vibe. Each of four floors is unique, with great simple decor. The location is easy to miss; the doorway is tucked in a narrow opening. Local craft beer here and cocktails.\nRead more\nWritten June 9, 2020",
