            "review_text": "Jboogy420\nChicago, Illinois2 contributions\n0\nBest burgers in Hanoi!\nSep 2019 • Couples\nAs an American, I love burgers. So of course I had to try out this restaurant after reading the reviews. I was so blown away. The burger was perfectly cooked and had an amazing incorporation of local flavors into a Western classic. It was a truly enlightening experience, not to mention delicious. We also had a fantastic beer and a super fresh smoothie cocktail. Would absolutely recommend. \n\nThe owner happened to be there as well and showed us around the restaurant. She was so friendly and kind! Wonderful people.\nRead more\nWritten September 20, 2019",
